WEBVTT

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:07.303
[slow motion] I love you guys.

00:00:16.747 --> 00:00:18.749
Why aren't we firing?

00:00:18.923 --> 00:00:21.665
They're taking out
our gunners, sir.
They're getting close.

00:00:23.232 --> 00:00:26.583
Fire! Fire!
F-F-Fire at them!

00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:28.802
But, sir, we'll kill our own.

00:00:28.976 --> 00:00:30.935
I said, fire at them!

00:00:31.109 --> 00:00:32.110
Fire!

00:00:34.808 --> 00:00:35.766
No.

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:37.898
[groans]

00:00:43.339 --> 00:00:44.296
Po!

00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:54.437
[coughing]

00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:21.464
Tigress?

00:01:46.402 --> 00:01:47.620
[groans]

00:01:52.973 --> 00:01:54.714
[laughs]

00:02:11.296 --> 00:02:12.993
As you wish.

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:15.213
Let's finish this.

00:02:38.454 --> 00:02:39.542
Fire!

00:02:44.808 --> 00:02:48.246
[Po] Inner peace.
Inner peace. Inner peace.

00:03:05.872 --> 00:03:07.570
Aaieee!

00:03:07.744 --> 00:03:09.049
Ho, ho, ho!

00:03:09.223 --> 00:03:10.355
Cha, cha, cha!

00:03:14.054 --> 00:03:15.055
Again!

00:03:17.449 --> 00:03:18.929
Whoa, whoa!

00:03:21.192 --> 00:03:22.236
[gasps]

00:03:22.411 --> 00:03:23.760
Yeah! [grunts]

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:27.633
Kill him! Somebody kill him!

00:03:29.505 --> 00:03:31.985
Aah... oh!

00:03:32.508 --> 00:03:33.465
Ha, ha!

00:03:43.954 --> 00:03:44.911
Yai!

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.743
- [cheering]
- What?

00:03:50.917 --> 00:03:52.223
[Shen] No!

00:03:58.925 --> 00:04:00.318
Keep firing!

00:04:00.492 --> 00:04:01.885
Keep firing!

00:04:09.936 --> 00:04:11.721
Aaahh!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:23.341
Skadoosh!

00:04:36.615 --> 00:04:37.616
[coughs]

00:04:54.285 --> 00:04:55.591
How did you...?

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:58.637
How did you do it?

00:05:02.641 --> 00:05:04.077
You know, you just
keep your elbows up

00:05:04.251 --> 00:05:05.165
and keep the shoulders loose.

00:05:05.339 --> 00:05:06.515
[Shen] Not that.

00:05:06.689 --> 00:05:08.473
How did you find peace?

00:05:08.647 --> 00:05:10.780
I took away your parents.

00:05:10.954 --> 00:05:12.303
Everything.

00:05:12.477 --> 00:05:14.827
I scarred you for life.

00:05:15.001 --> 00:05:17.438
See, that's the thing, Shen.

00:05:17.613 --> 00:05:19.005
Scars heal.

00:05:19.179 --> 00:05:21.268
No, they don't.

00:05:21.442 --> 00:05:23.183
Wounds heal.

00:05:23.357 --> 00:05:24.968
Oh, yeah.
What do scars do?

00:05:25.142 --> 00:05:28.449
- They fade, I guess.
- I don't care what scars do.

00:05:28.624 --> 00:05:30.321
You should, Shen.

00:05:30.495 --> 00:05:32.062
You gotta let go
of that stuff from the past

00:05:32.236 --> 00:05:34.455
'cause it just doesn't matter.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:39.069
The only thing that matters
is what you choose to be now.

00:05:39.243 --> 00:05:40.679
You're right.

00:05:40.853 --> 00:05:43.203
Then I choose... this!

00:05:49.079 --> 00:05:50.080
Aargh!

00:06:10.143 --> 00:06:11.188
Whoa!

00:06:12.406 --> 00:06:14.278
Ohh! Aargh!

00:06:20.806 --> 00:06:21.764
[gasps]

00:06:21.938 --> 00:06:24.070
[cheering]

00:06:26.464 --> 00:06:27.465
[sighs]

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:38.171
That was pretty hardcore.

00:06:47.572 --> 00:06:51.924
- Po, come here! Yeah!
- Don't ever do that
again, please.

00:06:52.098 --> 00:06:55.711
It seems you have
found inner peace.

00:06:55.885 --> 00:06:58.278
And at such a young age.

00:06:58.452 --> 00:07:00.237
Well, I had a
pretty good teacher.

00:07:00.411 --> 00:07:01.455
Oh!

